  "id": "retrieval-cue",
  "term": "retrieval cue",
  "definition": "A retrieval cue is a prompt or piece of information linked to stored memories that helps bring them back to mind. When several memories share the same cue, presenting that cue can reactivate more than one memory and make them compete for recall.",
